cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SkillsGoat
message: If you use SkillsGoat, please cite it.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: Nipun
    affiliation: "Optimus Labs"
license: MIT
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-09"
repository-code: "https://github.com/optimuslabs-io/skillsgoat"
abstract: >
  Labeled goat of agent skills (SKILL.md bundles) for scoring scanners.
  76 atomics (66 malicious, 10 benign) and 35 compound chains. Network C2
  is inert.
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - SKILL.md
  - security evaluation
  - malware collection
